				as its dividend. 
 0077  F7 F3			    div bx 
 0079  52			    push dx 
 007A  41			    inc cx 
 007B  0B C0			    or ax,ax 
 007D  75 F6			    jnz decimal_split 
 007F				decimal_write: 
 007F  5A			    pop dx 
 0080  80 C2 30			    add dl,'0' 
 0083  E8 008D R		    call put_char 
